 roommate and best friend."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A hardworker and take everything with earnestness. Her grade is one of the highest in the school. Furthermore, her Metis is dubbed as \"the absoulute shield\" and has the highest power level in history of Suminoe Gakuen. Despite all that, she is clueless when it comes to love."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"A perfect girl no matter how you look at it. However, it seems that there is more to her than meets the eye..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12466"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a11e91c66563b7df00581459cfcde6f074149092dfda69054f873a267301122a.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ce/cec73b04633c9ec42415e87f52cccbc9fd01f3ec20f624356e768de98f7ddefc.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"鮎川 ひなた","creatorId":"vndb:s650","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s650","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s650","name":"鮎川ひなた","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30139","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12467","characterName":"祐天寺 美汐","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12467"},"originalCharacterName":"祐天寺 美汐","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"725"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"89"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"159"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Metis: (Fire)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Keiji's kouhai. She is the leader of Argonauts and the daughter of Yuutenji family, the founder of Suminoe Gakuen. She leads a trustful relationship with her attendants, Tomo and Nao. Because of her positions, she puts on facade of a haughty ojousama, which both Keiji and Manami immediately see through. She is actually a docile girl, and has a hard time making friend. She seems to know Keiji in the past..."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12467"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/de/deb36e41e07eaaf98571309e8e68af0aeb6276910daa66185f4e2db510aa7e0c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/be/be099241c751d26fdba133ae56cadbba83245aa07a9f41c371795ffeec29c3f9.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"青山 ゆかり","creatorId":"vndb:s83","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s83","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s83","name":"友永 朱音","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30134","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12468","characterName":"速瀬 まなみ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12468"},"originalCharacterName":"速瀬 まなみ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"1201"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"87"},"height":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"154"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"88"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Metis: (Fortification on pencil)"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Hayase Keiji's younger sister. She harbors romantic feeling toward Keiji. After Keiji got transfered to Suminoe Gakuen, she works hard to wake up her own Metis so she can get to the same school as him, which ends up successful. Even though she is brutally honest to people, she can't help but be dishonest towards Keiji, making her feeling obvious to everyone, including her parents"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"and Keiji himself"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"An outgoing girl. She sees every girls close to Keiji as her rival, although she can't bring herself to hate them and will actually help the girls win his heart."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"It is revealed that her metis is manifestation of her wish to penetrate any possible obstacle that hinder her to be by Keiji's side. It is able to do both hardening on object and nulification technique that can break physical and Metis laws."}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c12468"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ba/ba0b611b8f602d4ee084e83156e5992253837d519e39b515bc640ff1856f57b1.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/38/38606a49e3af7fe9284b81618e07739241c9ea20f6b6eb82bd0ba9bc7247acde.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"ヒマリ","creatorId":"vndb:s284","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s284","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s284","name":"朋永 真季","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:30133","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c12469","characterName":"沖原 琴羽","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c12469"},"originalCharacterName":"沖原 琴羽","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value